  "prefLabel": "Pes 506.08 Modifying or Rescinding a Special Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 506.08 Modifying or Rescinding a Special Permit. The division, after a hearing pursuant to RSA 541-A where a finding is made that conditions of a special permit have not been met, shall:\n\n(a) Change the conditions of the special permit if it is still possible for the applicant to comply and make the proposed application of pesticides; or\n\n(b) Rescind the special permit if there is no longer sufficient time to comply with the conditions and still make the proposed application.\n\nSource. #2666, eff 4-3-84; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #6834, eff 8-26-98; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
